\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252  This grip acts as the bridge between the physics of the string and the pen.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning2\insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 \hich\af2\dbch\af31506\loch\f2 o\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li1440\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx1440\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls3\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin1440\itap0\pararsid14158252 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 
If you grip the pen tightly, your hand forces the entire pen to match your hand's exact movement, killing any independent vibration.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning2\insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 \hich\af2\dbch\af31506\loch\f2 o\tab}By holding it loosely, you create a low-resistance, pivotable }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 boundary condition}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 \emdash 
much like the loose string. This allows the pen to pivot freely, lag behind your hand's motion, and execute the harmonic oscillations required to create the "floppy" optical illusion.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14158252 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid14158252\charrsid14158252 The Unified Connection
